        "content": "**2. Generate & Send Reminder**\nAI writes a short, friendly reminder for each client and sends it by email."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b346996e-b528-4b61-abbb-78ad949d30d7",
      "name": "Sticky - sticky-sec3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        5136,
        848
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1520,
        "height": 738,
        "content": "**3. Track Reply & Recover**\nAfter the wait, checks Gmail for a reply. If the customer replied, it's logged. If not, AI drafts a polite follow-up email, sends it, and logs it."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "71eb3398-86ae-4efa-b2fb-5493bd865bf7",
      "name": "Sticky - sticky-main",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2352,
        784
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#FBD85B",
        "width": 588,
        "height": 772,
        "content": "## **AI Appointment Reminder & No-Show Recovery Agent**\n\n**Who it's for:** Any business with bookable appointments (clinics, salons, consultants) that wants fewer no-shows without manually chasing clients.\n\n**What it does:** Emails clients a reminder before their appointment, checks whether they replied, and sends a polite AI-written follow-up if they haven't. Every outcome is logged to Google Sheets.\n\n**How it works**\n1. Checks Calendly every 2 hours for appointments starting within 24 hours\n2. AI writes a short, friendly reminder and emails it to the client\n3. Waits, then checks Gmail for a reply from that client\n4. If they replied, logs it as \"Customer Replied\"\n5. If not, AI drafts a follow-up email, sends it, and logs it\n\n**How to set up**\n\u2610 Connect Calendly (Bearer Auth) and replace the placeholder user URI with your own\n\u2610 Connect OpenAI\n\u2610 Connect Gmail (sending and reply check)\n\u2610 Connect Google Sheets and select your own log spreadsheet in both Log nodes\n\n**CUSTOMIZATION**\n- Change the reminder window (default: 24 hours) and the check interval (default: every 2 hours)\n- Change how long the workflow waits for a reply\n- Adjust the AI prompts to match your tone"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
